# The rocket heart: a whole bundle transplanted, re-hosted, its frequency spreading; black becomes grey.
# Source: owner, chat 1 T66, T95, T102; executed in C1-EXP-002 (the same bundle behaves differently per host).
LANGUAGE RSOS 0.2
WORLD rocket_worlds
HOST body KIND human CHANNELS visual, auditory, kinesthetic
HOST planet KIND planet
OBJECT rocket KIND engine DOMAIN engineering
PROPERTY rocket.propulsion = 1.0
PROPERTY rocket.boundaries = "strong"
PART body.heart KIND organ
PART body.bones KIND structure
USE HOST body
CONSENT body FOR practice, cues BY body
BASELINE body
TRANSPLANT rocket TO body.heart AS rocket_heart
FLOW rocket_heart DIRECTION vertical TO body
FLOW rocket_heart DIRECTION horizontal TO body
RESONATE body.bones WITH rocket_heart
FLOW rocket_heart DIRECTION outward
SHIFT planet.surface FROM black TO grey
REHOST rocket_heart IN planet AS planet_core
# D84 knowing form: the White Dragon chooses the part, depth, order and expected gain
TRANSPLANT rocket TO body.heart FROM engineering DEPTH structure ORDER 1 GAIN efficiency
